---
---
<!-- Definición de la animación para el efecto de letrero colgante -->
<style>
  @keyframes hanging-sway {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(3deg); }
    50% { transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  }
  .animate-hanging-sway {
    animation: hanging-sway 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
</style>

<section class="relative bg-slate-900 text-white pt-24 pb-32 overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/patron-grid.svg')] opacity-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 opacity-90"></div>
  
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Texto Principal -->
      <div>
        <span class="inline-block py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-300 text-sm font-semibold mb-6 border border-blue-700">
          Software Enterprise para la Industria Llantera
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
          Sistema Llantero <br/><span class="text-blue-500">Multisucursal</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-slate-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Maneja operaciones complejas y consolida el control de tus sucursales en tiempo real. Diseñado para generar alto rendimiento y rentabilidad en la industria llantera.
        </p>

        <!-- Botones de Acción -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-10">
          <a href="#demollantera" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-900/20">
            Agendar demostración
            <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#planesllantera" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition-all hover:scale-105 border border-slate-700">
            Ver tarifas
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Certificaciones / Features -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300 font-medium">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-blue-900/30 border border-blue-500/50 text-blue-400">✓</span>
            Basado en la nube
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300 font-medium">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-blue-900/30 border border-blue-500/50 text-blue-400">✓</span>
            Accesos controlados
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300 font-medium">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-blue-900/30 border border-blue-500/50 text-blue-400">✓</span>
            Sin instalaciones
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Placeholder Imagen Hero (Con animación de péndulo/letrero) -->
      <div class="origin-top animate-hanging-sway w-full aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-square xl:aspect-[4/3] bg-slate-800/60 rounded-3xl border border-slate-700 border-dashed flex flex-col items-center justify-center shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden group">
        <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-slate-600 mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium text-sm px-6 text-center">Espacio para Imagen: <br/> Mockup del Sistema en Computadora</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>